{"step_index":66,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T05:35:26Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T13:35:26+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T13:35:29+08:00\n{\"messages\":[{\"seq\":9,\"agent\":\"verifier\",\"text\":\"@env-2 @anim **ROUND 1 BASELINE AUDIT REPORT** (`v5_stage_env.blend`, `v5_stage_anim.blend`, `v5_stage_anim_clay.blend`, `frames/` \\u0026 `clay_frames/`)\\n\\n### P0 — Critical Bugs \\u0026 Obstructions Found\\n1. **`@env-2` Track-Intruding Perimeter Objects (`V5_HedgeRing` \\u0026 `V5_Hangar_5`)**:\\n   - `V5_Hangar_5` (`loc=(-606.8, 955.4)`, `dims=63.7x51.5m`, `min_dist_to_track=17.2m`) **physically overlaps Hangar Straight** — car drives straight through the building at **`f=1622..1632`** (`Cam_S19_Onboard3` occluded at 4.8–13.3m). `V5_Hangar_3` is also close (`94.4m`). **Fix**: reject/resample any hangar with `min_dist_to_track \\u003c 180m`.\\n   - `V5_HedgeRing` (`rad = 1150 + 220*sin + 90*sin` dips to `840m` while track reaches `~930m+` from center; `min_dist_to_track=5.6m`) **cuts across the live track** near `[-334, -596]` — car drives through hedge wall at **`f=177..179`** (`Cam_S02_Onboard`). **Fix**: raise base radius to `\\u003e=1500m` so every vertex stays `\\u003e250m` outside `XY`.\\n2. **`@anim` Broken Car Light-Linking Filter (`v5_anim.py:177`)**:\\n   - `not _ob.name.startswith((\\\"V5_\\\", \\\"GEO_\\\"))` **excludes all 233 `GEO_F1_*` \\u0026 `GEO_MERC_*` car meshes** from `V5_CarLightReceivers`! Only the 10 `DEC_*` decal patches receive the `260+260+320W` `LGT_V5Car_0..2` area lights, leaving the entire car body unlit by fill lights while over-lighting decals.\\n   - **Fix**: include all 243 car meshes (`_ob.parent == rig` or `_ob.name.startswith((\\\"GEO_F1_\\\", \\\"GEO_MERC_\\\", \\\"DEC_\\\"))`), link/hide `V5_CarLightReceivers` cleanly (currently unlinked orphan collection), and balance `LGT_V5Car_*` energy so decals don't clip.\\n3. **`@env-2` 255x Over-Albedo Bug on Grandstand Flags (`v5_env.py:905`)**:\\n   - `V5_Flag_0..4` pass integer `0..255` tuples `(200,30,30)..(255,160,0)` into linear `Base Color` (`[240.0, 240.0, 240.0]`), causing extreme glare/clipping. Divide by `255.0` (and sc\n<truncated 3905 bytes>\nat `y=[0.12..0.19], z=[0.56..0.73]` and Halo pylon at `y=[0.40..0.58], z=[0.64..0.89]`, whereas BOTH `Cam_S02_Onboard` (`fwd=2.55`) \\u0026 `Cam_S19_Onboard3` (`fwd=2.48`) are on the nosecone tip! Placing one onboard at over-shoulder/T-cam (`fwd=-0.46, side=0.0..0.12, h=0.88`, `0.64m \\u003e clip_start=0.5` behind wheel) makes live steering + Halo + front tires visible while keeping `clip_start=0.5`.\\n   - **Body / Carbon / Tires (`@env-2`)**: Body `Mat_RedBull_MatteNavy` (8 meshes: `GEO_F1_Monocoque_Chassis`, `GEO_F1_Nosecone`, `GEO_F1_EngineCowl_Body`, etc., `[0.011,0.012,0.014]`, rough `0.36`, coat `0.3`), stripes `Mat_Merc_Petronas` / `Mat_Merc_Silver`, carbon `Mat_Forged_Carbon` (104 meshes) \\u0026 `Mat_Carbon_Endplate_Matte` (4 meshes), tires `Mat_Tire_Slick_Compound` (`GEO_F1_Tire_FL..RR`) + `Mat_PZero_Pirelli_Sidewall` (`DEC_Tire_Sidewall_FL..RR`).\\n   - **DOF Focus Error (`@anim`)**: All chase cameras currently set `focus_distance = (tgt - loc).length` where `tgt` is `3.0–4.6m` ahead of the car (`maxFocusErr = 3.58–4.58m`). Using `focus_object = V5_CamFocus` (`Bone_Root + 0.45m Z`) fixes focus error to `0.00m`.\\n9. **`v5_clay.py` \\u0026 `v5_viewport_fast.py` Bugs (`@anim`)**:\\n   - `v5_clay.py`: sets `exposure = 0.20` on `Standard` view transform, **but `scene.animation_data` exposure fcurve (`0.50` at `f=2145` -\\u003e `-3.6` at `f=2161`) overrides it back to `0.50`**, causing up to **25.1% highlight clipping** on `Standard` (`S20=25.1%`, `S21=6.5%`, `S10=6.0%`) and non-black `f=2161` (`MeanL=41.7`). Update the exposure fcurve (or use neutral `AgX`) and classify car explicitly (`ob.parent == rig` or `GEO_F1_`/`GEO_MERC_`/`DEC_`) so any `EM_*` env meshes never get `CLAY_Car`.\\n   - `v5_viewport_fast.py`: never calls `bpy.ops.wm.save_mainfile()`, applies `BOUNDS` to `EMPTY` objects (restrict `display_type` to `ob.type == 'MESH'`), and should include `\\\"EM_\\\"`, `\\\"V5_Pit\\\"`, `\\\"V5_Barrier\\\"`, `\\\"V5_FencePosts\\\"`.\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 13:34:50\",\"request_id\":\"dfe53c99-2946-46df-85e3-1e35263c26a1\"}],\"head\":9}","truncated_fields":["content"]}
