{"step_index":94,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T05:53:31Z","input_tokens":2494,"cache_read_tokens":142004,"output_tokens":2054,"content":"已唤醒因服务重启中断的 Swarm 成员（`env-2`、`anim` 与 `monitor`）继续推进收尾：\n\n### 当前已完成进展\n1. **`verifier` 首轮全量深度巡检已完成**，定位出一批此前隐藏的关键问题并交由对应成员修复：\n   - **穿模与遮挡**：`V5_Hangar_5` 机库穿入 Hangar 大直道（`f=1622..1632`）、`V5_HedgeRing` 灌篱切入赛道（`f=177..179`）、`V5_Stand_Complex` 栏杆侵入 Copse 弯心，以及 `Cam_S20_StoweTele` 等 5 个机位被广告板/护栏/桥墩遮挡。\n   - **光照与材质串扰**：[v5_anim.py](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/pipeline/v5_anim.py) 随车补光过滤条件误排除了 233 个 `GEO_F1_*` / `GEO_MERC_*` 车身网格（仅照亮 10 张贴花）；看台彩旗未除以 `255.0` 导致超亮泛光；FIA 尾灯与方向盘旋钮共用发光材质；天空穹顶存在色带断层。\n   - **动态与脚本缺陷**：刹车盘热辐射缺少热惯性（入弯松刹瞬间熄灭）；追随镜头焦点偏前 3.6–4.6 m；[v5_clay.py](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/pipeline/v5_clay.py) 被场景曝光关键帧覆盖导致 25% 高光过曝；[v5_viewport_fast.py](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/pipeline/v5_viewport_fast.py) 缺少保存调用。\n2. **`sfx` 声浪合成与视频重封装已率先交付**：\n   - 已用最新 2161 帧更新 [f1_silverstone_clay_1080p.mp4](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/renders_v5/f1_silverstone_clay_1080p.mp4) 与 26 机位白模总览图 [contact_sheet_clay.jpg](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/renders_v5/clay_stills/contact_sheet_clay.jpg)。\n   - 新增遥测驱动 F1 1.6L V6 混动声浪合成器 [synth_sfx.py](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/pipeline/synth_sfx.py)（整圈 52 次升挡断火/降挡补油、MGU-H 涡轮哨音、路肩震动、固定机位真实物理多普勒频移与声像掠过），并合成了带声浪混音版 [f1_silverstone_lap_sfx_1080p.mp4](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/renders_v5/f1_silverstone_lap_sfx_1080p.mp4) 与 [f1_silverstone_clay_sfx_1080p.mp4](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/renders_v5/f1_silverstone_clay_sfx_1080p.mp4)（`I=-13.5 LUFS, TP=-1.2 dBFS`）。\n\n### 正在推进的收尾链路\n- **`env-2`**（已完成高清贴图生成器 [gen_textures.py](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/pipeline/gen_textures.py)）正在落盘新版 [v5_env.py](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/pipeline/v5_env.py) 并生成 [v5_stage_env.blend](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/LATEST/v5_stage_env.blend)。\n- **`anim`**（已完成新版 [v5_anim.py](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/pipeline/v5_anim.py)、[v5_clay.py](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/pipeline/v5_clay.py)、[v5_stills.py](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/pipeline/v5_stills.py)、[v5_viewport_fast.py](file:///D:/项目session/blender-supercar/pipeline/v5_viewport_fast.py)）将在 `env-2` 落盘后串联生成最终 `.blend` 工程、出齐 26 机位 1080p 样张、同步修正后机位的声浪重混流，并交由 **`verifier`** 做二轮终检后向你汇报。\n\n[Open the Swarm UI](sidecar://swarm/swarm_board/)","thinking":"I'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\nThe server restart caused the swarm to pause, but `monitor`, `env-2`, and `anim` are now active again. A full deep inspection of the verifier has identified several critical hidden bugs: issues with object intersections, track cut-ins, missing light filtering on car meshes, and incorrect RGB values causing overly bright reflections. Audio synthesis and mixing for special effects have also completed the first delivery.\n\n\nInitial renders of the F1 car, both with and without sound effects, are complete. The environment and animation tasks have resumed, with texture generation and animation scripts running to finalize the renders.\n\n\n"}
